# Product Price Watch — multi-product daily price tracker (DISABLED template)
#
# Status: DISABLED. The `.yaml_OFF` extension makes this file invisible to
# `digests/*.yaml` globs, so neither `scripts/generate_workflows.py` nor the
# digest loader picks it up. Rename to `digests/product-price-watch.yaml` to
# enable.
#
# One digest, many products. Each `products[]` entry has one or more retailer
# URLs. The price_watch runtime (src/price_tracker.py):
#   * fetches each URL once
#   * extracts the most likely CAD price using JSON-LD + visible-text regex
#   * stores the observation in SQLite (table: price_history)
#   * surfaces an item when the price is first observed, changes, or drops
#     to/below `desired_price_cad`
#
# Limitations: some retailers (Amazon, Walmart, Best Buy) render price values
# client-side via JavaScript that requests+BeautifulSoup cannot evaluate. For
# those URLs the digest reports "price unavailable" — pair with a service like
# camelcamelcamel/RedFlagDeals if cent-level accuracy matters. Provide exact
# product-page URLs (not search listings) for best results.
id: product-price-watch
enabled: false
type: price_watch
schedule:
  type: daily
  hour: 5
  minute: 0
  timezone: America/Toronto

email:
  subject: Product Price Watch
  to: []

products:
  - id: galaxy-watch-8
    name: Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 (44mm)
    desired_price_cad: 399.99
    urls:
      - retailer: Best Buy Canada
        url: https://www.bestbuy.ca/en-ca/product/REPLACE-WITH-EXACT-SKU
      - retailer: Walmart Canada
        url: https://www.walmart.ca/en/ip/REPLACE-WITH-EXACT-SKU
      - retailer: Amazon Canada
        url: https://www.amazon.ca/dp/REPLACE-WITH-EXACT-ASIN
      - retailer: Costco Canada
        url: https://www.costco.ca/REPLACE-WITH-EXACT-PRODUCT
      - retailer: Samsung Canada
        url: https://www.samsung.com/ca/watches/galaxy-watch/REPLACE-WITH-EXACT-SKU
  # Add more products as needed — each one is independent.
  # - id: pixel-9
  #   name: Google Pixel 9
  #   desired_price_cad: 799.99
  #   urls:
  #     - retailer: Best Buy Canada
  #       url: https://www.bestbuy.ca/en-ca/product/...

render:
  intro: Daily price-movement scan across configured retailers. Verify the current price on the retailer page before buying — some pages render prices client-side and may report "unavailable".
